  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kuj3gzus6w_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>devv.ai 之前流量主要是国内，后来被墙之后，流量就腰斩了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kuj3gzus6w_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>最近28天只有40万访问量。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kuj3gzus6w_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>其实现阶段，要想生成效果好，建议套模板，基于模板去改动</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kuj3gzus6w_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>后来上线的国内专供域名，访问量很少。</div>\n<div>而且后来好出现了 metaso.cn 、kimi.moonshot.cn 等产品，竞争出现了，devv 的国内领先优势就没了。</div>",
